        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued August 6 at 7:36PM EDT by NWS Charleston WV</headline>
        <description>2 inches of rain has fallen between Busseyville and Louisa. This
will cause creeks and streams to rise near bankfull, along
with ponding of water on roadways and water problems in low-lying
areas and areas with poor drainage.

Motorists should be prepared for water on roadways. Do not drive
your vehicle through flooded roadways.
</description>
