        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued August 6 at 8:57PM EDT by NWS Miami FL</headline>
        <description>Temperatures will remain in the 80s over the east coast metro
areas this evening with dew points in the mid 70s. This will make
the heat index readings be in the mid to upper 90s over the east
coast metro areas through the evening hours. People need to use
caution while out this evening and continue to drink plenty of
water.
