        <senderName>NWS Gaylord MI</senderName>
        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued August 7 at 7:39PM EDT by NWS Gaylord MI</headline>
        <description>At 739 PM EDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm over
Ossineke Township, or 7 miles west of The Town Of Hubbard Lake,
moving east at 25 mph.

HAZARD...Penny size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Minor hail damage to vegetation is possible.

Locations impacted include...
Ossineke, The Town Of Hubbard Lake, Spruce, Ossineke Township,
Hubbard Lake, and Devils Lake.
</description>
        <instruction>If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building.</instruction>
        <web>http://www.weather.gov</web>
