            <value>WWUS85 KMSO 080009</value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>NWSheadline</valueName>
            <value>Strong thunderstorms will impact portions of northeastern Missoula, southeastern Flathead, northeastern Granite and northwestern Powell Counties through 645 PM MDT</value>
