        <headline>Marine Weather Statement issued August 8 at 7:47PM EDT by NWS Tampa Bay Ruskin FL</headline>
        <description>A Marine Weather Statement has been issued for the following areas...
Coastal waters from Englewood to Tarpon Springs FL out 20 NM...
Waters from Englewood to Tarpon Springs FL out 20 to 60 NM...

At 747 PM EDT, Doppler radar indicated a strong thunderstorm, capable
of producing winds to around 30 knots. This thunderstorm was located
19 nm west of Egmont Key, moving southwest at 15 knots.
</description>
        <instruction>Mariners can expect gusty winds to around 30 knots, locally higher
waves, and lightning strikes. Boaters should seek safe harbor
immediately until this storm passes.</instruction>
