        <description>At 548 PM MST, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm 13
miles west of West Poker Mountain, or 42 miles east of Globe, moving
southeast at 10 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 40 mph.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects.

This storm will remain over mainly rural areas of Gila County.
</description>
        <instruction>If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building.</instruction>
