        <headline>Hydrologic Outlook issued August 9 at 8:03PM CDT by NWS Kansas City/Pleasant Hill MO</headline>
        <description>ESFEAX

A Hydrologic Outlook is no longer in effect for the...

Grand River near Chillicothe

Flooding which was previously forecast is not expected to occur
because forecasted rainfall totals have been lowered.

Additional weather and stream information is available at
www.weather.gov/kc/.
